            <ArticleTitle>Very late coronary spasm inducing acute myocardial infarction in a heart transplant recipient.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e235-e236</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.2459/JCM.0000000000000049</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>: We report coronary angio findings of very late (10-year) coronary spasm inducing acute myocardial infarction with typical chest pain in a heart transplant recipient. Coronary spasm was promptly relieved by intra-coronary infusion of nitrates.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
